        "source": "// Looks at the spot where the mobs arrive and swings the sword every 1.2 seconds.\nfn on_join(first) {\n    hotbar.select(1);\n    look.at(90.0, 10.0);\n    timer.every(1200, \"swing\");\n}\n\nfn on_respawn() {\n    hotbar.select(1);\n    look.at(90.0, 10.0);\n}\n\nfn on_timer(name) {\n    mouse.left.tap();\n}\n",
